#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:1
msgid "Compute resources and the global sandbox location"
msgstr "计算资源与全局沙箱位置"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:3
msgid ""
"Use Admin → Servers to deploy existing SSH machines or CloudLab "
"allocations, manage their leases, and choose where new sandboxes run. "
"Durable operations and renewal run in the control plane, so closing the "
"browser does not stop them. The [compute lifecycle "
"design](../agents/specs/2026-10-04-compute-resource-lifecycle-design.zh-"
"CN.md) records the underlying protocol; "
"[ENVIRONMENT.md](../../ENVIRONMENT.md#optional-compute-resource-"
"management) lists its configuration."
msgstr ""
"在 Admin → Servers 里，你可以部署已有的 SSH 机器或 CloudLab "
"分配、管理它们的租期，并决定新沙箱在哪里运行。持久化的操作和续期都在控制平面里执行，所以关掉浏览器也不会中断。底层协议见[计算资源生命周期设计](../agents/specs/2026-10-04"
"-compute-resource-lifecycle-design.zh-CN.md)，相关配置列在 "
"[ENVIRONMENT.md](../../ENVIRONMENT.md#optional-compute-resource-"
"management) 里。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:10
msgid ""
"The global location applies to **all new, still-unassigned sandbox "
"groups**. Retained groups, including stopped ones and their Fork members,"
" keep their original Host. `Automatic` clears the global restriction. An "
"explicitly selected unavailable Host keeps work waiting; it never "
"triggers a fallback."
msgstr ""
"全局位置只对**所有新建、还没分配主机的沙箱组**生效。已保留的沙箱组，包括已停止的组和它们的 Fork 成员，都留在原来的 Host 上。选 "
"`Automatic` 就取消全局限制。如果明确选了一台当前不可用的 Host，工作会一直等着它，绝不会自动换到别处。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:15
msgid "What must remain on stable infrastructure"
msgstr "哪些东西必须放在稳定的基础设施上"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:17
msgid ""
"Keep the control plane, Postgres, background worker, deployment profiles,"
" provider credentials and compute encryption key on stable "
"infrastructure. A managed resource runs only the Host, sandbox manager, "
"tunnels and sandboxes. Provider expiry remains a hard limit; renewal does"
" not guarantee uptime."
msgstr ""
"控制平面、Postgres、后台 worker、部署配置（deployment "
"profile）、服务商凭据和计算资源加密密钥，都要放在稳定的基础设施上。托管资源上只跑 Host、sandbox "
"manager、隧道和沙箱。服务商规定的到期时间是硬性上限；续期也不能保证机器一直在线。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:22
msgid ""
"Stored API tokens and management SSH keys are encrypted with "
"`AGENT_COMPUTE_SECRET_KEY`. The supported deployer generates a random "
"32-byte value in its persistent `.env` when none is configured; other "
"deployment systems must provide equivalent stable key material. Back it "
"up with the encrypted database: restoring the database without this key "
"cannot recover compute connections. Do not reuse gateway, session, "
"enrollment or sandbox manager keys. Compute management credentials never "
"enter sandboxes or the deployed Host."
msgstr ""
"保存的 API 令牌和管理用的 SSH 密钥，都用 `AGENT_COMPUTE_SECRET_KEY` "
"加密。如果没有配置，官方部署脚本会在它持久保存的 `.env` 里生成一个随机的 32 "
"字节值；用其他部署方式时，必须自己提供一份同样长期不变的密钥。这个密钥要和加密的数据库一起备份：只恢复数据库、没有这个密钥，计算资源的连接就恢复不了。不要拿网关、会话、注册或"
" sandbox manager 的密钥来充当它。计算资源的管理凭据永远不会进入沙箱，也不会进入部署好的 Host。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:30
msgid ""
"The Host separately needs purpose-scoped tunnel credentials and "
"`AGENT_SANDBOX_MANAGER_TOKEN`. The sandbox manager token is currently "
"pool-wide: every deployment profile must use the same value as the stable"
" control plane. Management SSH keys and sandbox manager authentication "
"serve different purposes."
msgstr ""
"Host 还需要另外两样东西：按用途限定的隧道凭据，以及 `AGENT_SANDBOX_MANAGER_TOKEN`。目前整个资源池共用同一个 "
"sandbox manager 令牌，所以每个部署配置都必须用和稳定控制平面相同的值。管理用的 SSH 密钥和 sandbox manager "
"的认证是两回事，各管各的。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:35
msgid "Supported initial deployment"
msgstr "支持的初始部署方式"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:37
msgid "Automatic SSH bootstrap supports:"
msgstr "自动 SSH 初始化支持以下环境："

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:39
msgid "Ubuntu 22.04 or 24.04 on x86-64."
msgstr "x86-64 架构上的 Ubuntu 22.04 或 24.04。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:40
msgid "Python 3, passwordless `sudo` and working KVM."
msgstr "Python 3、免密 `sudo`，以及可用的 KVM。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:41
msgid ""
"Reachable package repositories and the pinned Kata release when "
"installing prerequisites."
msgstr "需要安装前置依赖时，能访问软件包仓库和固定版本的 Kata 发布。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:44
msgid ""
"With `install_prerequisites=true`, bootstrap installs `docker.io`, "
"`docker-compose-v2`, `curl`, `ca-certificates`, `xz-utils` and "
"`nftables`, starts Docker, and runs the repository's checksum-pinned Kata"
" installer. With it false, Docker/Compose and the approved Kata runtime "
"must already exist. Both paths require Kata."
msgstr ""
"设置 `install_prerequisites=true` 时，初始化程序会安装 `docker.io`、`docker-"
"compose-v2`、`curl`、`ca-certificates`、`xz-utils` 和 `nftables`，启动 "
"Docker，并运行仓库里带校验和锁定的 Kata 安装脚本。设为 false 时，Docker/Compose 和经过批准的 Kata "
"运行时必须事先装好。两种方式都离不开 Kata。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:50
msgid ""
"The node does not need Cloud Agent preinstalled. Bootstrap transfers a "
"reviewed source bundle and configuration, then runs "
"`deploy/host/sandbox_host.sh up` and `check`. These checks verify Kata, "
"the guest observer, sandbox manager, relays and nftables. Admission stays"
" closed until deployment checks, an enrolled Host heartbeat and a "
"control-plane-to-sandbox-manager health check succeed."
msgstr ""
"节点上不需要预先装好 Cloud Agent。初始化程序会把一份评审过的源码包和配置传过去，然后运行 "
"`deploy/host/sandbox_host.sh up` 和 `check`。这些检查会确认 Kata、guest 观察器、sandbox"
" manager、中继和 nftables 都正常。只有部署检查通过、注册好的 Host 发来心跳、控制平面访问 sandbox manager "
"的健康检查也成功之后，才会开始接任务。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:56
msgid ""
"Automatic initial deployment supports one node per allocation. Multi-node"
" CloudLab experiments can be observed, but automatic deployment refuses "
"them rather than selecting one node. Failed or unsupported installation "
"leaves the resource visible and does not destroy it."
msgstr ""
"自动初始部署每个分配只支持一个节点。多节点的 CloudLab "
"实验可以纳入观察，但自动部署会直接拒绝，不会替你从中挑一个节点。安装失败或环境不受支持时，资源仍然留在列表里，不会被销毁。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:61
msgid "Preferred CloudLab node types"
msgstr "优先选用的 CloudLab 节点类型"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:63
msgid ""
"New CloudLab allocations try the following default list from top to "
"bottom. These general-purpose families were introduced in 2021 or later, "
"have at least 16 physical cores and 128 GiB RAM, and each has more than "
"20 total nodes. Hardware and totals were checked against the [CloudLab "
"hardware catalog](https://docs.cloudlab.us/hardware.html) and [public "
"inventory](https://www.cloudlab.us/portal-hardware.php) on October 12, "
"2026."
msgstr ""
"新建 CloudLab 分配时，会按下面的默认列表从上往下依次尝试。这几个通用机型系列都是 2021 年或之后推出的，至少有 16 "
"个物理核心、128 GiB 内存，每种的节点总数都超过 20 台。硬件参数和总数已在 2026 年 10 月 12 日对照 [CloudLab "
"硬件目录](https://docs.cloudlab.us/hardware.html)和[公开清单](https://www.cloudlab.us"
"/portal-hardware.php)核实过。"

