"host.env.example)"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:223
msgid "[Host field descriptions](../../deploy/host/.env.example)"
msgstr "[Host 各字段说明](../../deploy/host/.env.example)"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:225
msgid ""
"Copy them to a private configuration directory. Replace every example "
"address, token, network and all-zero digest/revision. Keep these files "
"outside Git. Secret files must be readable by the control-plane "
"container's UID 10001 and not world-readable; mount the directory read-"
"only."
msgstr ""
"把它们复制到一个私有的配置目录，替换掉所有示例地址、令牌、网络，以及全是零的摘要和修订号。这些文件不要放进 Git。secret "
"文件必须能被控制平面容器里的 UID 10001 读取，但不能对所有人可读；这个目录要以只读方式挂载。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:230
msgid ""
"The Servers form selects the first available profile in configuration "
"order. API clients may select a profile ID. Requests cannot provide "
"scripts, source paths, Docker flags or environment values. Encrypted "
"compute connections are referenced by connection ID. Operator-mounted "
"deployment secrets use the separate `deployment:<name>` namespace; "
"deployment files cannot reference compute connections."
msgstr ""
"Servers 表单会按配置里的顺序，选第一个可用的 profile；API 客户端可以指定一个 profile "
"ID。请求里不能带脚本、源码路径、Docker 参数或环境变量值。加密的计算资源连接通过连接 ID 引用。运维人员挂载的部署 secret "
"用另一套 `deployment:<name>` 命名空间；部署文件里不能引用计算资源连接。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:237
msgid ""
"Build a bundle from the reviewed commit that the control plane permits "
"Hosts to advertise. All components must use the same release revision:"
msgstr "用控制平面允许 Host 声明的那个评审过的 commit 构建源码包。所有组件都必须用同一个发布修订号："

