msgstr ""

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md
msgid "Dedicated installation directory on the remote node."
msgstr "远程节点上专用的安装目录。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:255
msgid ""
"The digest is verified before upload. The archive must contain the "
"reviewed repository root, without a containing directory or working-tree "
"secrets. Bootstrap rejects symlinks, path traversal and private "
"deployment state, and adds `.dockerignore` exclusions to keep tunnel "
"files out of image build contexts."
msgstr ""
"上传之前会先校验摘要。归档里必须直接是评审过的仓库根目录，外面不能再套一层目录，也不能带工作区里的 "
"secret。初始化程序会拒绝符号链接、路径穿越和私有的部署状态，并加上 `.dockerignore` "
"排除规则，让隧道相关的文件进不了镜像的构建上下文。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:260
msgid ""
"The first installation writes a marker binding `deploy_root` to its "
"allocation, node and Host. Retries reuse the marker and persisted "
"enrollment credential. A different marker or an unmarked existing "
"installation is refused. Manually enrolled Hosts remain manageable "
"through the original interface; bootstrap does not adopt their files."
msgstr ""
"第一次安装时会写一个标记，把 `deploy_root` 和它的分配、节点、Host "
"绑在一起。重试时会沿用这个标记和已保存的注册凭据。如果遇到的是另一个标记，或者一个没有标记的已有安装，就会拒绝。手动注册的 Host "
"仍然通过原来的界面管理，初始化程序不会接管它们的文件。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:266
msgid ""
"Each present allocation reserves a profile because the sandbox manager "
"reverse endpoint is fixed. Overlapping old/new Hosts need separate "
"profiles with different reverse ports, installation directories and "
"tunnel authorizations. Renaming a profile while reusing its endpoint does"
" not separate it. Selection skips live reservations; only confirmed "
"`terminated` or `absent` allocations free them. Identical retries retain "
"their operation and selected profile. The allocation transaction also "
"checks occupancy, so concurrent additions cannot share one. Refresh "
"availability before retrying a refused addition."
msgstr ""
"sandbox manager 的反向端点是固定的，所以每个现存的分配都会占用一个 profile。新旧 Host 同时存在时，需要分别用不同的 "
"profile，各自的反向端口、安装目录和隧道授权都不一样。只给 profile 改个名字、却沿用原来的端点，是分不开的。选择 profile "
"时会跳过仍被占用的；只有确认为 `terminated` 或 `absent` 的分配才会释放占用。完全相同的重试会沿用原来的操作和选中的 "
"profile。分配事务本身也会检查占用，所以同时进行的两次添加不会抢到同一个 profile。某次添加被拒绝后，先刷新一下可用情况再重试。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:275
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Choose `AGENT_EGRESS_CHAT_NETWORK_POOL`, the resolver and protected CIDRs"
" for the actual deployment; the sample range is illustrative. Preserve "
"the release's per-group nftables policy. Environment values must be "
"single-line dotenv data; they are never sourced as shell code. Supported "
"substitutions are `{deploy_root}`, `{host}`, `{node_id}` and "
"`{allocation_id}`."
msgstr ""
"`AGENT_EGRESS_CHAT_NETWORK_POOL`、DNS 解析器和需要保护的 "
"CIDR，要按实际部署环境来选；示例里的地址段只是演示用。保留这个发布自带的、按沙箱组设置的 nftables 策略。环境变量的值必须是单行的 "
"dotenv 数据，永远不会被当作 shell 代码执行。可以使用的替换变量有 "
"`{deploy_root}`、`{host}`、`{node_id}` 和 `{allocation_id}`。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:281
msgid "Three tunnels and the sandbox manager route"
msgstr "三条隧道和 sandbox manager 路由"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:283
msgid ""
"Provision tunnel authorization on the stable gateway/control-plane "
"machines before adding a server. Bootstrap cannot grant access to them. "
"Use three distinct keys with no shell authority and narrowly permitted "
"forwarding:"
msgstr ""
"添加服务器之前，先在稳定的网关和控制平面机器上配好隧道授权，初始化程序没有权限替你做这件事。要用三把不同的密钥，都不给 shell "
"权限，只允许严格限定的端口转发："

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md
msgid "Tunnel"
msgstr "隧道"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md
msgid "Remote destination"
msgstr "远端目标"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md
msgid "Audience"
msgstr "谁在用"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md
msgid "Inference"
msgstr "推理"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md
msgid "Gateway inference port, default `127.0.0.1:8080`"
msgstr "网关的推理端口，默认 `127.0.0.1:8080`"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md
msgid "Runner and sandbox relay"
msgstr "runner 和沙箱中继"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md
msgid "MCP"
msgstr ""

