msgid "Control plane's **MCP-only** listener, default `127.0.0.1:8001`"
msgstr "控制平面的 **MCP 专用**监听器，默认 `127.0.0.1:8001`"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md
msgid "Sandbox tool relay"
msgstr "沙箱的工具中继"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md
msgid "Host control"
msgstr "主机控制"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md
msgid "Main API, default `127.0.0.1:8000`"
msgstr "主 API，默认 `127.0.0.1:8000`"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md
msgid "Trusted runner only"
msgstr "只有受信任的 runner"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:293
msgid ""
"The Host control connection also reverse-forwards from the stable "
"control-plane machine to `sandbox-manager:8092`. Bind its listener to the"
" actual control-plane Docker bridge gateway address, never loopback or "
"`0.0.0.0`. Configure `GatewayPorts clientspecified`, restricting both the"
" key's reverse listen address/port and forward destination; never `yes`, "
"which binds every remote forward to the wildcard address. Firewall the "
"reverse ports on that machine so they answer only on its Docker bridge "
"interface ([sandbox manager route](operations.md#the-way-back-the-"
"control-plane-reaching-this-hosts-sandbox-manager)). Set "
"`AGENT_SANDBOX_MANAGER_ADVERTISE_URL` to the resulting URL reachable from"
" the control-plane container. Add its hostname/IP to "
"`AGENT_SANDBOX_MANAGER_URL_ALLOWED_HOSTS` when that allowlist is enabled."
" Every simultaneously deployed Host needs a distinct reverse port."
msgstr ""
"主机控制这条连接，还会从稳定的控制平面机器反向转发到 `sandbox-manager:8092`。它的监听地址要绑定在控制平面实际的 "
"Docker 网桥网关地址上，绝不能是回环地址或 `0.0.0.0`。配置 `GatewayPorts "
"clientspecified`，并同时限定这把密钥的反向监听地址、端口和转发目标；绝不能设成 "
"`yes`，否则所有远程转发都会绑定到通配地址上。在那台机器上用防火墙把这些反向端口限制住，只在 Docker 网桥接口上响应（见 "
"[sandbox manager 路由](operations.md#the-way-back-the-control-plane-"
"reaching-this-hosts-sandbox-manager)）。把 "
"`AGENT_SANDBOX_MANAGER_ADVERTISE_URL` 设成由此得到的、控制平面容器能访问到的 URL。如果启用了 "
"`AGENT_SANDBOX_MANAGER_URL_ALLOWED_HOSTS` 白名单，要把它的主机名或 IP 加进去。同时部署的每台 "
"Host 都需要不同的反向端口。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:307
msgid ""
"Verify existing-server and tunnel-server host keys through a trusted "
"source before adding them to their respective `known_hosts` files. `ssh-"
"keyscan` collects a candidate key; it does not authenticate it. Those "
"transports use strict host-key checking, isolated keys, no ambient SSH "
"configuration or agent, and no trust-on-first-use."
msgstr ""
"把已有服务器和隧道服务器的主机密钥写进各自的 `known_hosts` 之前，要通过可信的渠道核实。`ssh-keyscan` "
"只能拿到一个候选密钥，并不能证明它是真的。这些连接都启用严格的主机密钥检查，使用独立的密钥，不读取环境里的 SSH 配置或 "
"agent，也不接受\"第一次连上就信任\"。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:313
msgid ""
"CloudLab VMs use the manifest's SSH port and, by default, the control "
"plane connects without verifying the VM host key. This permits automatic "
"setup but is vulnerable to machine-in-the-middle impersonation of the "
"CloudLab node. Select **SSH host-key checking → Registered by the node at"
" first boot** when the Cloud Agent profile is available and host identity"
" must be pinned."
msgstr ""
"CloudLab 虚拟机使用 manifest 里给出的 SSH "
"端口；默认情况下，控制平面连接时不校验虚拟机的主机密钥。这样自动安装才能进行，但也意味着有人可以冒充 CloudLab 节点做中间人攻击。如果能用"
" Cloud Agent 的 profile，并且必须锁定主机身份，就选择 **SSH host-key checking → "
"Registered by the node at first boot**。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:319
msgid ""
"Unchecked intent is stored in a shape the immediately previous release "
"can read, but that release deliberately fails closed when an SSH-"
"dependent action encounters it. After an application rollback, existing "
"resource observation, lease and provider operations remain readable; "
"bootstrap, inventory or retirement that needs SSH must wait until this "
"release is restored. Redeploy forward before retrying the operation "
"rather than replacing the marker with unverified key material."
msgstr ""
"\"不校验主机密钥\"这个选择，保存的格式紧挨着的上一个发布也能读懂；但那个发布遇到依赖 SSH "
"的操作时，会有意拒绝执行。所以应用回滚之后，已有的资源观察、租期和服务商操作仍然能读；而需要 SSH "
"的初始化、清点或退役，要等恢复到这个发布之后才能做。要重试这类操作，请先往前重新部署，而不是拿一份没核实过的密钥去替换这个标记。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:327
msgid "CloudLab nodes that register their own host keys"
msgstr "自己登记主机密钥的 CloudLab 节点"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:329
msgid ""
"For automatic replacement, select **SSH host-key checking → Registered by"
" the node at first boot** in the CloudLab server's advanced options. This"
" applies only to experiments created by this control plane from the Cloud"
" Agent profile:"
msgstr ""
"要自动替换节点，在 CloudLab 服务器的高级选项里选择 **SSH host-key checking → Registered by "
"the node at first boot**。这只对本控制平面用 Cloud Agent profile 创建的实验有效："

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:334
msgid ""
"Publish [`deploy/cloudlab/cloud-agent-node.py`](../../deploy/cloudlab"
"/cloud-agent-node.py) as a **project-private** CloudLab profile. Set its "
"project and name as the server template. Its node, image and data-disk "
"parameters replace `small-lan`'s `phystype`, `osImage`, `dataMount` and "
"`dataSize`."
msgstr ""
"把 [`deploy/cloudlab/cloud-agent-node.py`](../../deploy/cloudlab/cloud-"
"agent-node.py) 发布为一个**项目私有**的 CloudLab "
"profile，并把它的项目和名称设为服务器模板。它自带的节点、镜像和数据盘参数，取代 `small-lan` 里的 "
"`phystype`、`osImage`、`dataMount` 和 `dataSize`。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:338
msgid ""
"Provide a public HTTPS control-plane address through "
"`AGENT_SESSION_REDIRECT_URI` or `AGENT_COMPUTE_REGISTRATION_URL`."
msgstr ""
"通过 `AGENT_SESSION_REDIRECT_URI` 或 `AGENT_COMPUTE_REGISTRATION_URL` "
"提供一个公开的 HTTPS 控制平面地址。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:340
msgid ""
"Each acquisition sends a one-time token in experiment parameters. The "
"control plane stores only its hash; it expires after two hours. At first "
"boot, the node generates fresh SSH host keys and posts their public "
"halves to `/v1/compute/node-registrations` over HTTPS. The control plane "
"pins the strongest registered key and uses strict checking against that "
"key alone."
msgstr ""
"每次申请节点时，都会在实验参数里带上一个一次性令牌。控制平面只保存它的哈希，两小时后过期。节点第一次启动时，会生成新的 SSH 主机密钥，并通过 "
"HTTPS 把公钥部分发到 `/v1/compute/node-"
"registrations`。控制平面会锁定登记上来的密钥里最强的那一把，之后只认这一把，严格校验。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:346
msgid ""
"The token registers keys once; it cannot claim work, enroll or rename a "
"Host. Repeating the same keys succeeds, different keys are refused, and a"
" newer token from a resubmitted acquisition supersedes the old token. "
"CloudLab project members can read experiment parameters, including the "
"token, and already administer all project nodes. Keep the profile private"
" and restrict project membership."
msgstr ""
"这个令牌只能用来登记一次密钥，不能认领任务，也不能注册或重命名 "
"Host。用同样的密钥重复登记会成功，换了密钥会被拒绝；重新提交申请会带来一个新令牌，旧令牌随之作废。CloudLab "
"项目成员能看到实验参数，令牌也在其中，不过他们本来就能管理项目里的所有节点。所以要让 profile 保持私有，并控制项目成员的范围。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:353
msgid ""
"If an operation stays at `waiting_for_registration` and ends with "
"`registration_expired`, inspect `/var/lib/cloud-agent-node/registration` "
"through the CloudLab console and verify that the node can reach the "
"registration URL. After fixing the cause, retry the operation: the node's"
" own token gets another two hours. Then restart the node from CloudLab so"
" its boot script posts the token again; it stops trying after an hour or "
"a refusal. Alternatively, release the server: nothing ran on a node that "
"never registered, so its release needs no SSH inventory. "
"`registration_unavailable` means no public HTTPS control-plane address is"
" configured."
msgstr ""
"如果某个操作一直停在 `waiting_for_registration`，最后以 `registration_expired` 结束，就通过 "
"CloudLab 控制台查看 `/var/lib/cloud-agent-"
"node/registration`，确认节点能访问登记地址。把原因修好后，重试这个操作，节点自己的令牌会再延长两小时。然后在 CloudLab "
"上重启节点，让启动脚本再发一次令牌；脚本在一小时后或被拒绝后就不再尝试。另一个办法是直接释放这台服务器：节点从没登记成功，上面什么都没跑过，释放时也就不需要通过"
" SSH 清点。`registration_unavailable` 表示没有配置公开的 HTTPS 控制平面地址。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:363
msgid "Enable legacy file-backed profiles"
msgstr "启用旧式的、基于文件的 profile"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:365
msgid ""
"Admin-managed profiles require no compute directory or JSON "
"configuration. CloudLab deployments still set the verified Portal API "
"URL; existing-SSH deployments do not. The variables below are retained "
"for deployments that continue to mount profiles and credential files."
msgstr ""
"由管理员在界面上管理的 profile，不需要计算资源目录，也不需要 JSON 配置。CloudLab 部署仍然要设置核实过的 Portal "
"API 地址；已有 SSH 机器的部署则不用。下面这些变量是为仍在挂载 profile 和凭据文件的部署保留的。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:370
msgid "Set these values in the private deployment environment:"
msgstr "在私有的部署环境里设置这些值："

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:378
msgid ""
"Place `compute.json`, `bundles/host.tar.gz` and `secrets/` under the "
"absolute host directory named by `AGENT_COMPUTE_DIRECTORY`. In source and"
" packaged artifact deployments, `deploy/control-plane/deploy.sh` "
"automatically adds `docker-compose.compute.yml` when this variable is in "
"the environment or persistent `.env`. The overlay mounts the directory "
"read-only at `/run/compute` and sets "
"`AGENT_COMPUTE_CONFIG=/run/compute/compute.json` on the main API. The "
"MCP-only listener receives neither the mount nor compute credentials."
msgstr ""
"把 `compute.json`、`bundles/host.tar.gz` 和 `secrets/` 放到 "
"`AGENT_COMPUTE_DIRECTORY` 指定的主机绝对路径下。无论源码部署还是打包的产物部署，只要环境里或持久化的 `.env` "
"里有这个变量，`deploy/control-plane/deploy.sh` 就会自动加上 `docker-"
"compose.compute.yml`。这个 overlay 会把目录只读挂载到 `/run/compute`，并给主 API 设置 "
"`AGENT_COMPUTE_CONFIG=/run/compute/compute.json`。MCP "
"专用监听器既拿不到这个挂载，也拿不到计算资源凭据。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:386
msgid ""
"Manual Compose commands must explicitly include `-f deploy/control-plane"
"/docker-compose.compute.yml`. Other deployment systems may set "
"`AGENT_COMPUTE_CONFIG` and supply equivalent read-only mounts. The image "
"includes `openssh-client`; the control plane receives no Docker socket or"
" root privilege. Apply database migrations before starting the worker."
msgstr ""
"手动执行 Compose 命令时，必须显式加上 `-f deploy/control-plane/docker-"
"compose.compute.yml`。用其他部署方式时，可以自己设置 "
"`AGENT_COMPUTE_CONFIG`，并提供同样的只读挂载。镜像里带有 `openssh-client`；控制平面拿不到 Docker "
"socket，也没有 root 权限。启动 worker 之前，先执行数据库迁移。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:392
msgid ""
"Existing-SSH deployments can leave `AGENT_CLOUDLAB_API_URL` unset. "
"CloudLab has no guessed endpoint default: the public specification's "
"development HTTP example is unsuitable for credentials. CloudLab's "
"[portal-api README](https://gitlab.flux.utah.edu/emulab/portal-api) gives"
" the production HTTPS Portal API as `https://boss.emulab.net:43794`. Set "
"that as the **CloudLab API URL** setting (or `AGENT_CLOUDLAB_API_URL`), "
"then run **Connections → Validate**. The portal's web address, "
"`www.cloudlab.us`, is another machine and does not serve the API: its "
"port 43794 is filtered, so a URL naming it waits out the 60-second "
"connect timeout and reports that CloudLab could not be reached. "
"Validation makes a read-only authenticated experiment-list request, "
"checks its response shape and refuses redirects. Local downloaded tokens "
"are never uploaded automatically."
msgstr ""
"已有 SSH 机器的部署可以不设 `AGENT_CLOUDLAB_API_URL`。CloudLab 没有预设的默认地址，因为公开规范里开发用的 "
"HTTP 示例不适合传凭据。CloudLab 的 [portal-api "
"README](https://gitlab.flux.utah.edu/emulab/portal-api) 给出的生产环境 HTTPS "
"Portal API 是 `https://boss.emulab.net:43794`。把它填进 **CloudLab API URL** "
"设置（或者设 `AGENT_CLOUDLAB_API_URL`），然后运行 **Connections → Validate**。门户网站的地址 "
"`www.cloudlab.us` 是另一台机器，并不提供这个 API：它的 43794 端口被过滤了，所以填这个地址的话，会一直等到 60 "
"秒的连接超时，然后报告连不上 "
"CloudLab。验证时会发一个只读的、带认证的实验列表请求，检查响应格式，遇到重定向就拒绝。你在本地下载的令牌永远不会被自动上传。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:405
msgid "Provider references:"
msgstr "服务商的参考资料："

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:407
msgid ""
"[CloudLab Portal API manual](https://docs.cloudlab.us/advanced-"
"topics.html)"
msgstr "[CloudLab Portal API 手册](https://docs.cloudlab.us/advanced-topics.html)"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:408
msgid ""
"[Portal API OpenAPI source](https://gitlab.flux.utah.edu/emulab/portal-"
"api/-/blob/master/openapi.json)"
msgstr ""
"[Portal API 的 OpenAPI 源文件](https://gitlab.flux.utah.edu/emulab/portal-"
"api/-/blob/master/openapi.json)"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:410
msgid "Day-to-day workflow"
msgstr "日常操作流程"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:412
msgid ""
"Use **Admin → CloudLab** to set the project, initial duration, template "
"project, template name, SSH user, and the SSH public key installed for "
"that user. These are non-secret defaults only; an administrator can "
"change them for one allocation. Leave the public key blank to use keys "
"already on the CloudLab account."
msgstr ""
"在 **Admin → CloudLab** 里设置项目、初始时长、模板项目、模板名称、SSH 用户，以及给这个用户安装的 SSH "
"公钥。这些都只是不涉密的默认值，管理员可以针对单个分配另行修改。公钥留空，就用 CloudLab 账号上已有的密钥。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:418
msgid ""
"In **Admin → Servers**, choose **Add server** and select existing SSH or "
"CloudLab."
msgstr "在 **Admin → Servers** 里点 **Add server**，选择已有 SSH 机器或 CloudLab。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:420
msgid ""
"Create or select credentials inline. Existing SSH needs a private key and"
" verified node host keys. CloudLab needs an API token and a management "
"SSH private key; its advanced options can replace the default unchecked "
"host with first-boot host-key registration. Credential responses expose "
"metadata only."
msgstr ""
"在表单里直接新建或选择凭据。已有 SSH 机器需要一把私钥和核实过的节点主机密钥。CloudLab 需要一个 API 令牌和一把管理用的 SSH "
"私钥；在它的高级选项里，可以把默认的\"不校验主机密钥\"换成节点首次启动时登记主机密钥。凭据相关的响应只返回元数据。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:424
msgid ""
"Enter the resource details. Existing SSH needs an address, port and user."
" CloudLab needs an exact experiment UUID to attach, or a profile and "
"explicitly selected project to provision, plus its SSH user. A public key"
" set with that user is sent as the experiment's additional SSH key when "
"the experiment is created."
msgstr ""
"填写资源信息。已有 SSH 机器需要地址、端口和用户。CloudLab 要么提供一个确切的实验 UUID 用来挂接，要么提供一个 profile "
"和明确选定的项目来新建，另外都要填 SSH 用户。如果给这个用户设置了公钥，创建实验时会把它作为实验的附加 SSH 密钥一起发过去。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:429
msgid ""
"Submit and follow the durable operation until ready. HTTP 202 confirms "
"only that the operation was recorded; allocation, installation, "
"enrollment and readiness are separate steps."
msgstr "提交后，跟踪这个持久化的操作，直到它就绪。HTTP 202 只表示操作已经记录下来；分配、安装、注册和就绪是分开的几个步骤。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:432
msgid ""
"Select the ready Host as the **global sandbox location** if desired. "
"Becoming ready does not change the saved location. New unassigned groups "
"follow it; retained groups remain on their original Host."
msgstr ""
"需要的话，把就绪的 Host 设为**全局沙箱位置**。Host 就绪本身不会改动已保存的位置。之后新建、还没分配的沙箱组会去这台 "
"Host；已保留的沙箱组仍留在原来的 Host 上。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:435
msgid ""
"Review the allocation's complete scope before enabling renewal. Attached "
"or imported resources require explicit lifecycle adoption. Supply a real "
"reason and ordered lead times. Confirm extensions from observed expiry "
"and the last result; saving policy alone does not extend a lease."
msgstr "开启续期之前，先把这个分配的完整范围看一遍。挂接或导入进来的资源，需要你明确接管它的生命周期。要填一个真实的理由，以及按顺序排列的提前时间。延期有没有成功，要看观察到的到期时间和最近一次的结果；光保存策略并不会延长租期。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:440
msgid ""
"Observation-only imports record resource facts without installation. "
"After explicit adoption they can support lease management, but observing "
"nodes does not establish that their retained state is disposable. Release"
" still requires active Host bindings and verified inventory."
msgstr ""
"只做观察的导入只记录资源的基本情况，不做安装。明确接管之后，可以用来管理租期；但能观察到节点，并不说明节点上保留的状态可以丢掉。释放时仍然要求有活跃的"
" Host 绑定，以及核实过的清单。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:445
msgid "Recovery and release boundaries"
msgstr "恢复与释放的边界"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:447
msgid ""
"Reuse the recorded operation after browser disconnects or worker "
"restarts. It persists request ID, exact parameters, step and resource ID."
" A new request ID creates a new command. **Activity**, and each server's "
"**Activity** tab, list the 200 most recent operations and every one still"
" pending, running, waiting or `unknown`, however old, so an operation "
"waiting for an administrator stays there with its controls. So does a "
"failed or blocked acquisition of a server not confirmed gone, which can "
"still hold the server until a retry or **Nothing was created** settles "
"it."
msgstr ""
"浏览器断开或 worker 重启之后，沿用已记录的那个操作即可。操作里保存了请求 ID、确切的参数、当前步骤和资源 ID。换一个新的请求 "
"ID，就会创建一条新命令。**Activity** 页面和每台服务器的 **Activity** 标签页，会列出最近的 200 "
"个操作，外加所有还在排队、运行、等待中或者状态是 `unknown` "
"的操作，不管多久以前的都列。所以等管理员处理的操作会一直留在那里，操作按钮也在。申请服务器时失败或被阻塞、而服务器还没确认已经没了的操作也一样：在重试或"
" **Nothing was created** 把它了结之前，它仍可能占着这台服务器。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md
msgid "Result"
msgstr "结果"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md
msgid "Recovery"
msgstr "怎么恢复"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md
msgid "CloudLab could not be reached"
msgstr "连不上 CloudLab"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md
msgid ""
"The message names the endpoint it tried and why. A host name that does "
"not resolve, a refused connection, or no connection within 60 seconds "
"points at the **CloudLab API URL** setting or a firewall between the "
"control plane and CloudLab: the URL is `https://boss.emulab.net:43794`, "
"and the control plane must reach that port. A reset connection usually "
"means a proxy or firewall in between. A failed TLS handshake usually "
"means the URL names a port that does not speak HTTPS. An expired "
"certificate is CloudLab's to replace: the Portal API has intermittently "
"served one, so report it to CloudLab. The operation retries every 30 "
"seconds on its own; **Connections → Validate** checks the setting "
"immediately."
msgstr ""
"消息里会写明它尝试连接的端点，以及失败的原因。主机名解析不了、连接被拒绝，或者 60 秒内连不上，问题一般出在 **CloudLab API "
"URL** 设置上，或者控制平面和 CloudLab 之间的防火墙上：这个地址应该是 "
"`https://boss.emulab.net:43794`，控制平面必须能访问这个端口。连接被重置，通常是中间有代理或防火墙。TLS "
"握手失败，通常是 URL 里写的端口不走 HTTPS。证书过期得由 CloudLab 来换：Portal API "
"时不时会出现过期的证书，遇到了就报告给 CloudLab。这个操作会每 30 秒自动重试一次；**Connections → Validate**"
" 可以马上检查这个设置。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md
msgid "SSH key or identity refused"
msgstr "SSH 密钥或身份被拒绝"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md
msgid ""
"Verify the machine/key, update the selected connection and retry the same"
" operation. Existing-SSH and registered CloudLab connections keep host-"
"key checks enabled."
msgstr "核实机器和密钥，更新所选的连接，然后重试同一个操作。已有 SSH 机器和已登记密钥的 CloudLab 连接，始终开启主机密钥校验。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md
msgid "Cloud create outcome unknown, no UUID saved"
msgstr "不知道云端创建成功没有，也没保存 UUID"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md
msgid ""
"Identify the actual experiment in the exact account/project and resolve "
"explicitly. The worker never repeats POST or adopts an experiment by "
"name. If the portal has no experiment for the request, **Nothing was "
"created** closes it: the operation is cancelled, never retried, and the "
"server shows as not created and can be removed. That is the "
"administrator's statement, made without asking the provider, so check the"
" portal first. A node of the request that registered refuses it, and so "
"does any saved UUID, node or Host, or a provider diagnostic that names an"
" experiment or says the create was accepted. Autoscaled acquisitions keep"
" their own cancellation."
msgstr ""
"在确切的账号和项目里找到实际的那个实验，然后明确地处理。worker 绝不会重复发 "
"POST，也不会按名字去认定实验。如果门户上没有这次请求对应的实验，就用 **Nothing was created** "
"把它了结：操作会被取消、不再重试，服务器显示为未创建，可以移除。这是管理员自己的声明，不会去问服务商，所以先去门户上确认清楚。以下情况会拒绝这个操作：这次请求有节点已经注册；保存过任何"
" UUID、节点或 Host；服务商的诊断信息里提到了某个实验，或者说创建请求已被接受。自动扩缩容的申请有自己的取消方式。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md
msgid "UUID saved, later observation failed"
msgstr "UUID 已保存，之后的观察失败了"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md
msgid ""
"Repair access and resume the same resource. Releasing the server instead "
"deletes that experiment by its saved UUID."
msgstr "修好访问权限，接着处理同一个资源。如果改为释放服务器，就会按保存的 UUID 删除那个实验。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md
msgid "Installation or readiness failed"
msgstr "安装或就绪检查失败"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md
msgid ""
"Inspect deployment checks, repair prerequisites/profile and retry the "
"same resource. Failure does not destroy it."
msgstr "查看部署检查的结果，修好前提条件或 profile，然后对同一个资源重试。失败不会把资源销毁。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md
msgid "Extension pending or unknown"
msgstr "延期还没确认，或结果不明"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md
msgid ""
"Check actual expiry. Retries retain the fixed absolute target; shorter "
"extensions are not successful. The provider may reject or limit "
"extensions. An expiry that has not moved ten minutes after the request "
"blocks as `extension_unconfirmed`, so the server's other operations and a"
" replacement can proceed; retry sends the same target again."
msgstr ""
"先查实际的到期时间。重试时，目标的绝对到期时间保持不变；只延长了一部分不算成功。服务商可能拒绝延期，或者限制延期的长度。如果请求发出十分钟后到期时间还没变，操作会以"
" `extension_unconfirmed` 阻塞，这样这台服务器的其他操作和替换还能继续；重试时会再发一次同样的目标。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md
msgid "Retained state remains"
msgstr "还有保留的状态"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md
msgid ""
"Keep the resource available or manage its chat lifecycle. Stopped "
"containers and archived chats remain dependencies."
msgstr "让资源继续可用，或者处理好上面那些对话的生命周期。已停止的容器和已归档的对话，都还算依赖。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md
msgid "Release committed, response unknown"
msgstr "释放已经提交，但不知道结果"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md
msgid ""
"Keep admission closed and confirm the exact immutable resource ID. "
"Cancellation cannot undo release."
msgstr "保持准入关闭，确认那个确切的、不可变的资源 ID。释放一旦提交，取消也撤销不了。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:467
msgid ""
"A CloudLab DELETE response of `204` confirms deletion of the exact "
"experiment UUID. A terminal experiment object with the matching UUID and "
"project also provides evidence. A `404` alone does not: token visibility "
"can change even when an authenticated list succeeds. The adapter reports "
"`resource_visibility_unknown` and keeps the reservation. After a lost "
"DELETE acknowledgement followed by `404`, the operation remains committed"
" pending provider confirmation; it neither reports success nor frees the "
"profile. Restore access and retry the existing operation. Do not bypass "
"fences or edit database state to infer deletion. The public API has no "
"project-permission query that strengthens this evidence."
msgstr ""
"CloudLab 的 DELETE 返回 `204`，就能确认这个确切的实验 UUID 已经删除。拿到一个 UUID "
"和项目都对得上、且处于终态的实验对象，也可以作为证据。但单独一个 `404` "
"不行：即使带认证的列表请求成功了，令牌能看到的范围也可能变了。这时适配器会报告 "
"`resource_visibility_unknown`，并继续占着那个 profile。如果 DELETE 的确认丢了，之后又拿到 "
"`404`，操作会停在\"已提交、等待服务商确认\"的状态，既不报告成功，也不释放 "
"profile。恢复访问权限后，重试现有的这个操作。不要绕过栅栏，也不要改数据库来假定资源已删除。公开 API "
"里也没有能查项目权限、让这条证据更可靠的接口。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:478
msgid ""
"The reconciler can classify a missing experiment as `expired_not_found` "
"after a previously recorded lease deadline plus ten minutes. Unknown or "
"unexpired deadlines leave absence ambiguous."
msgstr ""
"如果之前记录过租期截止时间，那么过了截止时间再加十分钟，调和器就可以把找不到的实验归为 "
"`expired_not_found`。截止时间未知或还没到时，\"找不到\"仍然说明不了什么。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:482
msgid ""
"Enabled renewal continues while retirement waits on retained state. "
"Renewal does not clear manual Drain or resource-owned admission holds. "
"The claim transaction enforces the last known hard lease cutoff even if "
"the resource worker stops."
msgstr ""
"退役在等保留状态清空期间，已开启的续期会照常进行。续期不会解除手动的 Drain，也不会解除资源自己加的准入限制。即使资源 worker "
"停了，认领事务也会按最后已知的租期硬截止时间执行。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:487
msgid "Pool and resource actions have different effects:"
msgstr "资源池操作和资源操作的效果不一样："

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md
msgid "Action"
msgstr "操作"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md
msgid "Effect"
msgstr "效果"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md
msgid "`Remove from pool`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md
msgid ""
"Revokes the Host credential; leaves the machine intact. A Host still "
"running sandboxes that can move to another Host moves them out first, as "
"one does before its lease ends (below): it takes no new work and shows "
"`removing`, each idle sandbox stops into a checkpoint and is handed over,"
" and the reaper revokes the Host once none is left and its running turns "
"have finished. A Host still running turns moves out the same way whenever"
" another Host could take its sandboxes, since a turn it is restoring, or "
"one it claimed before the removal, leaves its sandbox running there. A "
"stopped sandbox its checkpoint covers moves when the Host is revoked. "
"Before leaving any sandbox behind, because no other Host can take it or "
"it can never move (its checkpoint failed, or its first turn failed before"
" Docker created its container, say), the page asks; removing anyway "
"leaves it on the Host until the Host returns."
msgstr ""
"吊销 Host 凭据，机器本身不动。如果这台 Host 上还有能迁到别的 Host "
"的沙箱，它会先把它们迁出去，做法和租期结束前的迁出一样（见下文）：它不再接新工作，显示 "
"`removing`；每个空闲沙箱停下来存成检查点，再交出去；等沙箱都迁完、正在跑的轮次也结束了，reaper 就吊销这台 Host。只要别的 "
"Host 能接手它的沙箱，还有轮次在跑的 Host "
"也照样这样迁出，因为它正在恢复的轮次，或者移除之前就认领的轮次，会让对应的沙箱继续在它上面运行。已停止、并且有检查点覆盖的沙箱，会在 Host "
"被吊销时迁走。如果有沙箱要被留下，比如没有别的 Host 能接手，或者它根本没法迁（检查点失败了，或者第一轮在 Docker "
"创建容器之前就失败了），页面会先问你；坚持移除的话，它会留在这台 Host 上，直到 Host 回来。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md
msgid "`Cancel removal`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md
msgid ""
"Puts a `removing` Host back to work. Sandboxes already moved stay on "
"their new Hosts."
msgstr "让一台 `removing` 状态的 Host 重新开始工作。已经迁走的沙箱留在新的 Host 上。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md
msgid "`Remove now`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md
msgid ""
"Revokes a `removing` Host at once and ends its running turns: they are "
"requeued once, or a chat whose turn may already have run is marked lost. "
"Sandboxes not yet moved stay on the removed Host."
msgstr ""
"立即吊销一台 `removing` 状态的 "
"Host，并结束它上面正在跑的轮次：这些轮次会重新排队一次；如果某个对话的轮次可能已经跑过，这个对话就标记为 lost。还没迁走的沙箱留在被移除的"
" Host 上。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md
msgid "`Forget`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md
msgid ""
"Removes an eligible history record. A `cold` sandbox, which waits in its "
"checkpoint for any Host, does not block it."
msgstr "删除一条符合条件的历史记录。`cold` 沙箱在自己的检查点里等任意一台 Host 来接手，不会挡住这个操作。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md
msgid "`Retire/release`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md
msgid ""
"Releases the complete allocation; for CloudLab, the whole experiment. An "
"acquisition still waiting on the server, for its Host's first heartbeat "
"say, is cancelled when the release commits, and so is an upgrade a "
"control-plane release queued for it: nothing can run either afterwards. "
"An autoscaled server's profile is then free for the pool once the release"
" is confirmed, and later releases move its deployment profile as usual. "
"Existing SSH has no cloud-destruction capability."
msgstr ""
"释放整个分配，对 CloudLab 来说就是整个实验。如果某次申请还在等这台服务器，比如在等它的 Host "
"第一次心跳，释放一提交，这次申请就会被取消；控制平面发布新版本时给它排上的升级也一样：之后这两件事都不会再执行。自动扩缩容的服务器，释放一经确认，它的"
" profile 就能交还给资源池；之后的版本发布照常把它的部署 profile 往前升级。已有 SSH 机器没有销毁云资源这一说。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md
msgid "`Remove server`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md
msgid ""
"Deletes the server's records once its resource is released, was never "
"created, or (attached without release) its Hosts are disabled; it calls "
"no provider. An operation still running, still confirming a provider "
"call, or whose outcome is `unknown` keeps them: [Removing a "
"server](operations.md#removing-a-server) says what ends each. One that "
"stopped while confirming a call no longer keeps a server whose provider "
"confirmed the machine gone."
msgstr ""
"资源释放之后、从来没创建过，或者（不经释放直接挂接的）它的 Host "
"已经禁用时，删除这台服务器的记录；不调用任何服务商。只要还有操作在运行、还在确认某次服务商调用，或者结果是 "
"`unknown`，这些记录就会保留：每种情况怎么了结，见[移除服务器](operations.md#removing-a-server)。如果一个操作在确认调用时停了下来，而服务商已经确认机器没了，它就不会再挡住这台服务器。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:498
msgid ""
"The page has no separate pause action. A Host held by a deployment drain "
"shows `updating`; one drained through the `/drain` API shows `paused` and"
" offers `Resume new work`."
msgstr ""
"页面上没有单独的暂停操作。被部署排空占着的 Host 显示 `updating`；通过 `/drain` API 排空的 Host 显示 "
"`paused`，并提供 `Resume new work` 按钮。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:502
msgid ""
"Release requires complete scope, no global placement reference, no "
"running, in-flight or retained dependencies, and fresh sandbox manager "
"and machine inventory. Stopped or unrecognized containers, orphan "
"networks/volumes, offline sandbox managers and incomplete inventory block"
" it. There is no force bypass. The only machine without an inventory is a"
" CloudLab node whose host-key registration never completed: this control "
"plane never connected to it."
msgstr ""
"释放必须满足这些条件：范围完整；没有被全局放置引用；没有正在运行、进行中或保留的依赖；sandbox manager "
"和机器的清单都是最新的。已停止或认不出来的容器、孤立的网络或卷、离线的 sandbox "
"manager，以及不完整的清单，都会拦住释放。没有强制绕过的选项。唯一不需要清单的机器，是主机密钥一直没登记成功的 CloudLab "
"节点，因为本控制平面从来没连上过它。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:509
msgid "Moving sandboxes out before a lease ends"
msgstr "租期结束前把沙箱迁出去"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:511
msgid ""
"A Host whose allocation does not use automatic replacement moves its "
"sandbox groups to other Hosts one at a time before its lease ends, "
"through their [restorable checkpoints](operations.md#restoring-a-removed-"
"hosts-sandboxes). The lead is **Move sandboxes to other servers before "
"expiry** in the allocation's renewal settings: 120 minutes by default, 0 "
"to turn it off. Replacement moves the whole Host instead, so the setting "
"is not offered there. With renewal enabled, extension is tried 15 minutes"
" before the window opens: longer than an extension the provider neither "
"applies nor refuses is awaited, so by then it has been granted or given "
"up, and only a lease it could not extend starts a move. The window is "
"capped 25 minutes short of the extension horizon, so an extension that "
"succeeds ends a move rather than starting one."
msgstr ""
"如果一台 Host "
"所在的分配没有开启自动替换，它会在租期结束前，借助各沙箱组的[可恢复检查点](operations.md#restoring-a-removed-"
"hosts-sandboxes)，把沙箱组一个一个迁到其他 Host 上。提前多久开始，由分配续期设置里的 **Move sandboxes to"
" other servers before expiry** 决定：默认 120 分钟，设为 0 就关闭。开了自动替换的话，会把整台 Host "
"一起换掉，所以那里不提供这个设置。开启续期时，会在窗口打开前 15 "
"分钟先尝试续期。服务商既不执行也不拒绝的续期请求，等待时间比这还短，所以到窗口打开时，续期要么已经批下来，要么已经放弃，只有续不上的租约才会开始迁出。窗口最长只到续期目标时长减"
" 25 分钟，这样续期成功只会让迁出结束，而不会刚续完又开始迁出。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:523
msgid ""
"Inside the window the Host gets a `move_out` admission hold only when its"
" groups can really move:"
msgstr "进入窗口之后，只有沙箱组确实能迁走时，这台 Host 才会被加上 `move_out` 准入限制："

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:526
msgid ""
"lifecycle archives and checkpoints are enabled, and every Host of the "
"allocation advertises `sandbox-checkpoints-v1` and has applied the "
"current archive revision;"
msgstr "生命周期归档和检查点都已开启，并且这个分配里的每台 Host 都声明了 `sandbox-checkpoints-v1`、已应用当前的归档配置；"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:529
msgid ""
"another online, enrolled Host that advertises restore and archives on the"
" current archive revision would pass claim admission for new groups now. "
"A Host under a `new_groups` hold, in its own lease window or with a stale"
" observation does not count, and of two Hosts entering their windows "
"together only one moves out. When an `untrusted-kata-v1` group would "
"move, that Host must also run the Kata runtime: no other Host is ever "
"handed such a chat, so without one the group would wait in its checkpoint"
" for good."
msgstr ""
"另有一台在线、已注册、在当前归档版本上声明了恢复和归档能力的 Host，此刻能通过新建沙箱组的认领准入。处于 `new_groups` "
"限制下的、自己也在租期窗口里的、或者观测数据已过期的 Host，都不算数；两台 Host 同时进入窗口时，只有一台会迁出。如果要迁的是 "
"`untrusted-kata-v1` 沙箱组，那台 Host 还必须运行 Kata 运行时：这类对话绝不会交给不带 Kata 的 "
"Host，所以没有这样的 Host 的话，这个组会永远停在检查点里等。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:537
msgid ""
"Without a target nothing changes, and the Host serves until its lease "
"ends as before. A move that has started continues if its target goes "
"away, and stops if checkpoints do."
msgstr ""
"找不到能接手的 Host，就什么都不变，这台 Host 照旧服务到租期结束。迁出一旦开始，即使接手的 Host "
"后来没了也会继续；但检查点一停，迁出也就停了。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:541
msgid ""
"While the hold is in place the Host claims nothing. Every 15 seconds the "
"control plane asks it to stop each idle group, as an administrator's stop"
" would; a group with a running turn, operation, snapshot or open terminal"
" is left for the next pass, so running turns are never interrupted. The "
"stop stores the group's final checkpoint, and once that checkpoint covers"
" the group it becomes `cold` at once, without waiting for the Host to be "
"removed. Each chat's next turn is claimed by another Host and restored "
"there; to the user, that message waits a little longer than usual. A "
"sandbox whose deletion failed before its archive still serves its chats, "
"so it is counted, moved and, with a reclaimed machine, lost like any "
"other; one whose deletion is pending or verified is left to that "
"deletion. A pending deletion without an archive finishes without the Host"
" once the machine is reclaimed, as below."
msgstr ""
"限制生效期间，这台 Host 不认领任何任务。控制平面每 15 "
"秒让它停掉每个空闲的沙箱组，效果和管理员手动停止一样；还有轮次、操作、快照在进行，或者开着终端的沙箱组，留到下一轮再处理，所以正在跑的轮次绝不会被打断。停止时会保存这个组的最终检查点；检查点一覆盖到这个组，它就立即变成"
" `cold`，不用等这台 Host 被移除。之后每个对话的下一轮会由另一台 Host "
"认领，并在那里恢复；在用户看来，只是这条消息比平时多等了一会儿。如果一个沙箱的删除在归档之前就失败了，它仍在为它的对话服务，所以会和其他沙箱一样被计数、被迁走，机器被回收时也一样会丢失；删除正在进行或已经核实的沙箱，交给那次删除去处理。没有归档的待删除操作，在机器被回收之后，不需要这台"
" Host 也能完成，见下文。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:554
msgid ""
"In an autoscaled CloudLab pool a moving-out member stops counting toward "
"`min_hosts`, so its replacement is acquired while it still serves. It "
"still counts toward `max_hosts`: keep `max_hosts` at least one above "
"`min_hosts`, with a spare deployment profile, or the replacement waits. "
"The Servers page shows such a member as _moving out_; it is released at "
"its lease end as before. If groups are still unmoved five minutes before "
"the lease ends (or the claim-stop lead, if longer), because a turn is "
"still running, a checkpoint is missing or no Host can take them, "
"`compute_move_out_unfinished` alerts once."
msgstr ""
"在自动扩缩容的 CloudLab 资源池里，正在迁出的成员不再计入 `min_hosts`，所以它还在服务时，替换机就开始申请了。但它仍然计入 "
"`max_hosts`：请让 `max_hosts` 至少比 `min_hosts` 大 1，并多备一个部署 "
"profile，不然替换机只能干等。Servers 页面会把这样的成员显示为 _moving "
"out_，它仍然照旧在租期结束时释放。如果到了租期结束前五分钟（如果停止认领的提前量更长，就以那个为准），还有沙箱组没迁走，比如还有轮次在跑、缺检查点，或者没有"
" Host 能接手，`compute_move_out_unfinished` 会告警一次。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:563
msgid ""
"So that there is still time to act, `compute_move_out_blocked` alerts "
"once when the window opens and groups would stay. Its reason is either "
"why the move cannot start, followed by how many groups would stay, or how"
" many groups can never move because no checkpoint covers them or their "
"image cannot be pulled elsewhere. The reasons are `archives_disabled`, "
"`checkpoints_disabled`, `host_offline`, `host_without_checkpoints` (the "
"Host runs a release from before checkpoints), "
"`archive_settings_not_applied` and `no_restore_target`."
msgstr ""
"为了留出处理的时间，如果窗口打开时有沙箱组会留下来，`compute_move_out_blocked` "
"会告警一次。告警原因有两种：一种是迁出根本开始不了，并附上会留下的沙箱组数量；另一种是有多少个沙箱组永远迁不走，因为没有检查点覆盖它们，或者它们的镜像在别处拉取不到。具体的原因值有"
" "
"`archives_disabled`、`checkpoints_disabled`、`host_offline`、`host_without_checkpoints`（这台"
" Host 跑的是还没有检查点功能的旧版本）、`archive_settings_not_applied` 和 "
"`no_restore_target`。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:571
msgid ""
"When the provider confirms the machine is gone (`terminated`), covered "
"stopped groups become `cold` as above. Every other group its Host still "
"holds lost its only Docker copy with the machine: once the Host has been "
"silent for 10 minutes and no turn, claim or Fork of the group is in "
"flight, the group and its chats become LOST, their queued turns fail with"
" a reason, and `compute_groups_lost_with_server` reports how many. A "
"group an administrator was already deleting without an archive is deleted"
" instead, by the deletion worker's next attempt after those 10 minutes, "
"without asking the Host. The Host row stays for **Remove from pool**."
msgstr ""
"服务商确认机器已经没了（`terminated`）时，有检查点覆盖的已停止沙箱组会像上面说的一样变成 `cold`。这台 Host "
"上剩下的其他沙箱组，唯一的 Docker 副本已经随机器一起没了：等这台 Host 已经 10 "
"分钟没有任何动静，并且这个组没有正在进行的轮次、认领或 Fork，这个组和它的对话就会变成 "
"LOST，排队中的轮次会带着原因失败，`compute_groups_lost_with_server` "
"会报告有多少个。如果管理员本来就在不归档地删除某个组，这个组会改为直接删除：在那 10 分钟之后，由删除 worker "
"的下一次尝试完成，不需要问这台 Host。Host 那一行会保留下来，等你点 **Remove from pool**。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:581
msgid "Automatic CloudLab node replacement"
msgstr "CloudLab 节点自动替换"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:583
msgid ""
"Replacement transfers one entire Host, including stopped sandboxes and "
"native sessions. It preserves the Host name and sandbox namespace and "
"enrolls a fresh Host credential. It does not rebuild context from "
"transcripts; the control plane and database remain on stable "
"infrastructure."
msgstr ""
"替换是把一整台 Host 搬过去，包括已停止的沙箱和原生会话。Host 名称和沙箱命名空间保持不变，并注册一个新的 Host "
"凭据。它不会用对话记录去重建上下文；控制平面和数据库一直留在稳定的基础设施上。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:588
msgid "Before enabling replacement:"
msgstr "开启替换之前："

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:590
msgid ""
"Use a **provisioned, managed** single-Host CloudLab allocation with "
"`host_key_source=registration` and the private Cloud Agent profile."
msgstr ""
"使用一个**新建的、受托管的**单 Host CloudLab 分配，设置 "
"`host_key_source=registration`，并使用私有的 Cloud Agent profile。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:592
msgid ""
"Prepare two alternating deployment profiles with distinct tunnel keys and"
" reverse sandbox manager ports. Both must pin the same `deployment_sha` "
"and `source_sha256`; replacement never selects a profile from another "
"release. A control-plane host rollout advances every stored profile and "
"live snapshot that still pin that pair, including the spare, so the two "
"slots stay on one revision. A profile another deployment is installing is"
" left until its own rollout. Keep Docker/containerd versions compatible. "
"Set `data_mount` to the profile's local disk, for example `/mydata`; both"
" daemons use it through bind mounts."
msgstr ""
"准备两个轮流使用的部署 profile，各用不同的隧道密钥和反向 sandbox manager 端口。两者必须固定同一个 "
"`deployment_sha` 和 `source_sha256`；替换时绝不会选用另一个发布的 "
"profile。控制平面发布新版本、升级主机时，所有仍固定这对值的已保存 profile "
"和实时快照都会一起升级，备用的那个也不例外，这样两个槽位始终在同一个版本上。另一次部署正在安装的 "
"profile，会留到它自己那次升级时再处理。Docker 和 containerd 的版本要保持兼容。把 `data_mount` 设成这个 "
"profile 的本地磁盘，例如 `/mydata`；两个守护进程都通过绑定挂载使用它。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:602
msgid ""
"Enable renewal and replacement in Servers → renewal settings. Supply the "
"renewal reason and candidate hardware types in preference order. UI "
"defaults are a **180-minute replacement lead time** and **7-day maximum "
"node age**. Saving policy does not request an immediate move."
msgstr ""
"在 Servers → renewal settings "
"里开启续期和替换。填写续期理由，以及按优先顺序排列的候选硬件类型。界面上的默认值是**提前 180 分钟替换**，**节点最长使用 7 "
"天**。保存策略并不会立刻触发一次迁移。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:606
msgid ""
"Set `AGENT_ALERT_WEBHOOK_URL` for external operational alerts. Without "
"it, events remain in structured logs and operation status."
msgstr "想收到外部的运维告警，就设置 `AGENT_ALERT_WEBHOOK_URL`。不设的话，事件只会留在结构化日志和操作状态里。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:609
msgid ""
"Within the renewal window, extension is tried first. Refusal or "
"unconfirmed extension starts replacement; maximum-age nodes move instead "
"of extending while the move is on time. A move still unfinished at its "
"drain deadline, one that blocked, failed or was cancelled, keeps the old "
"node extended so the move cannot outlast its lease. Failed candidates are"
" released before trying the next type. Configuration or credential errors"
" stop immediately; the same failure class across three types stops with "
"an alert. Retry resumes the saved operation."
msgstr "进入续期窗口后，先尝试延期。延期被拒或无法确认，就开始替换；节点到了最长使用期限时，只要迁移还来得及，就直接迁移而不再延期。如果到排空截止时间迁移还没完成，或者迁移被阻塞、失败或被取消，就让旧节点继续延期，保证迁移不会拖过它的租期。失败的候选节点会先释放，再去试下一个类型。遇到配置或凭据错误会立即停止；同一类错误在三个类型上都出现，也会停止并告警。重试会从已保存的操作接着做。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:618
msgid ""
"The candidate installs the host recipe and receives a live pre-copy "
"without enrolling or claiming. Once it is prepared, the source waits for "
"an idle moment. At the drain deadline, new claims pause even if the "
"candidate is still preparing. Running turns finish while new messages "
"queue; urgent moves never kill an active turn. With the default one-hour "
"turn limit, this deadline is 100 minutes before expiry."
msgstr ""
"候选节点会安装主机 "
"recipe，并在不注册、不认领的情况下，先接收一次在线的预复制。准备好之后，源节点会等一个空闲的时机。到了排空截止时间，即使候选节点还没准备好，也会暂停新的认领。正在跑的轮次照常跑完，新消息先排队；就算迁移很急，也绝不会杀掉正在进行的轮次。按默认一小时的轮次时限，这个截止时间是到期前"
" 100 分钟。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:625
msgid ""
"The worker stops the source Host and container daemons, copies final "
"changes, transfers the database binding, starts the replacement and "
"verifies deployment, fresh heartbeat and sandbox manager access. The stop"
" takes the runner first, then the sandbox manager alone for up to 10 "
"minutes: its shutdown stops each running sandbox cleanly and, when "
"lifecycle archives are enabled, stores its final archive. Remaining "
"containers stop afterwards. A sandbox that Docker stopped without the "
"sandbox manager gets no final archive for that stop, but its chat "
"continues on the replacement. Claims resume only after successful "
"takeover is recorded durably. Recovery after that boundary can clean up "
"the source; it cannot restore its stale copy over new work."
msgstr ""
"worker 会停掉源 Host 和容器守护进程，复制最后的变更，转移数据库里的绑定，启动替换节点，并确认部署、新的心跳和 sandbox "
"manager 访问都正常。停止的顺序是：先停 runner，再单独停 sandbox manager，最多等 10 分钟。sandbox "
"manager 关闭时会把每个正在运行的沙箱正常停掉；如果开启了生命周期归档，还会保存它们的最终归档。剩下的容器随后再停。被 Docker "
"直接停掉、没经过 sandbox manager "
"的沙箱，这次停止就没有最终归档，但它的对话仍会在替换节点上继续。只有成功接管这件事被持久记录下来之后，才会恢复认领。过了这个节点之后的恢复，可以清理源节点，但不能拿源节点上过时的副本去覆盖新的工作。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:636
msgid ""
"Before confirmed takeover, failures restore the source. If the "
"replacement cannot be confirmed stopped, claims stay paused and the "
"operation blocks for attention. A source restart that loses its SSH "
"connection or times out is retried for ten minutes; a restart that still "
"fails, or any unexpected error after the source began stopping, blocks "
"with the urgent `compute_rotation_failed` alert and keeps claims paused. "
"An unexpected error before the stop blocks and resumes claims. "
"Cancellation is available before the stop begins; later failures use "
"recovery/retry. Cleanup failures retry without interrupting the "
"replacement and remain visible as failures. Source release still passes "
"retained-state and allocation guards."
msgstr ""
"确认接管之前出了错，会恢复源节点。如果无法确认替换节点已经停下，认领会一直暂停，操作会阻塞，等人处理。源节点重启时如果断了 SSH "
"或超时，会重试十分钟；重启还是失败，或者源节点开始停止之后出现任何意外错误，都会发出紧急的 `compute_rotation_failed` "
"告警并阻塞，认领继续暂停。如果意外错误发生在停止之前，操作会阻塞，但认领会恢复。停止开始之前可以取消；之后再出错，就走恢复或重试。清理失败会自动重试，不会打断替换，但仍会作为失败显示出来。释放源节点时，仍然要通过保留状态和分配相关的检查。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:647
msgid "Acceptance before enabling production traffic"
msgstr "对生产流量开放之前的验收"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:649
msgid ""
"Use disposable staging conversations and dedicated profiles. Record "
"operation IDs, source/replacement node identities, release revision and "
"observed pause without credentials."
msgstr ""
"使用用完即弃的 staging 对话和专用的 profile。记录操作 "
"ID、源节点和替换节点的身份、发布修订号，以及实际观察到的暂停时长，不要记录凭据。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:653
msgid ""
"Create a node through the deployed registration endpoint and verify its "
"pinned key is used for SSH. A boot-script-only probe does not cover this "
"path."
msgstr "通过已部署的登记接口新建一个节点，确认 SSH 用的是它被锁定的那把密钥。只测启动脚本的探测，覆盖不到这条路径。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:655
msgid ""
"Run Claude Code, its Fork and Codex with files and distinct context "
"markers. Use **Replace node now** and verify native continuation, Fork "
"separation, files and container IDs. Repeat across CloudLab sites."
msgstr ""
"分别在 Claude Code、它的 Fork 和 Codex 里跑带文件、带不同上下文标记的任务。点 **Replace node "
"now**，然后确认：原生会话能接上，Fork 之间互不影响，文件都在，容器 ID 也对得上。在不同的 CloudLab 站点上各做一遍。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:658
msgid ""
"Submit a message during paused claims; it must queue and run once after "
"takeover. Verify the source can no longer authenticate after re-"
"enrollment."
msgstr "在认领暂停期间发一条消息，它必须先排队，接管之后恰好运行一次。确认重新注册之后，源节点已经无法再通过认证。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:660
msgid ""
"Exercise refused renewal, an unavailable first hardware type, failed "
"final copy, failed target startup and a control-plane restart. Verify "
"saved-step rollback/continuation, failed-candidate release, and absence "
"of duplicate allocations or simultaneous serving copies."
msgstr "实际演练这些情况：续期被拒、首选硬件类型没有容量、最终复制失败、目标节点启动失败，以及控制平面重启。确认能按已保存的步骤回滚或继续、失败的候选节点会被释放，并且不会出现重复的分配，也不会有两份副本同时对外服务。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:664
msgid ""
"Run policy for **two weeks with at least two automatic moves**, checking "
"alerts, cleanup and retained chats. Unit tests and a manual migration do "
"not replace elapsed-time acceptance."
msgstr "让策略连续跑**两周，期间至少自动迁移两次**，检查告警、清理和保留的对话。单元测试和一次手动迁移，都代替不了这种需要时间积累的验收。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:668
msgid ""
"The [2026-10-10 manual staging drill](../agents/specs/2026-10-10"
"-cloudlab-node-rotation-design.zh-CN.md#验证二结果2026-10-10staging) moved "
"real sessions from Clemson to Utah with a 161-second pause. It preceded "
"the automatic workflow. Abrupt loss of the only source disk or "
"unavailable replacement capacity before expiry can still lose sessions; "
"keep separate off-node backups where required."
msgstr ""
"[2026-10-10 的手动 staging 演练](../agents/specs/2026-10-10-cloudlab-node-"
"rotation-design.zh-CN.md#验证二结果2026-10-10staging)把真实的会话从 Clemson 迁到了 "
"Utah，中间暂停了 161 "
"秒。那次演练是在自动流程上线之前做的。如果唯一的源磁盘突然坏掉，或者到期前找不到可用的替换容量，会话仍然可能丢失；有需要的话，请另外在节点之外做备份。"

#: ../developer/operations-compute.md:674
msgid ""
"Before live traffic, verify the intended CloudLab profile through "
"deployment, a real task, retained continuation and Fork on the same Host."
" Renewal success and unit tests do not prove the profile's virtualization"
" or network suitability. Adapter tests mock HTTP/SSH and neither contact "
"CloudLab nor spend its resources."
msgstr ""
"接入线上流量之前，在同一台 Host 上完整走一遍：部署、跑一个真实任务、续接保留的会话、做一次 Fork，以此确认选定的 CloudLab "
"profile 没问题。续期成功和单元测试都证明不了这个 profile 的虚拟化和网络是合适的。适配器测试模拟了 HTTP 和 "
"SSH，既不会连接 CloudLab，也不会消耗它的资源。"

